32:["$","p","p-2",{"children":"Drive times are for normal traffic. Jeddah's evening peaks, Friday prayers and the Umrah high seasons can add time inside the city; the intercity motorways are usually more predictable."}]
33:["$","h2","h2-2",{"id":"what-changes-the-price","children":"What changes the price"}]
34:["$","h3","h3-0",{"id":"the-route","children":"The route"}]
35:["$","p","p-3",{"children":"Distance is the foundation of every quote. A 20-minute airport-to-hotel ride and a four-hour run to Madinah are different products, so every route is quoted on its own."}]
36:["$","h3","h3-1",{"id":"the-vehicle","children":"The vehicle"}]
37:["$","p","p-4",{"children":["Through our partner network you can book an executive sedan, a full-size SUV, a van, a luxury car or a minibus. Bigger and more premium vehicles cost more. For Jeddah the choice is usually about ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"luggage"}],": pilgrims arriving for Umrah often travel with two large cases each plus Zamzam on the way home, which is why families pick an SUV or van even when a sedan would seat them. Compare capacities on our ",["$","$L25","a-0",{"href":"/fleet","children":"vehicle classes page"}],"."]}]
38:["$","h3","h3-2",{"id":"stops-and-waiting","children":"Stops and waiting"}]
39:["$","p","p-5",{"children":"A Miqat stop on the way to Makkah, a detour to collect a relative, or an hour's wait at a shopping mall all change the trip, so mention them when you book and they are included in the quote."}]
3a:["$","h3","h3-3",{"id":"what-does-not-change-it","children":"What does not change it"}]
3b:["$","p","p-6",{"children":"Time of day, traffic and demand. Once agreed, the fare stays the same — including late-night arrivals at JED, when many international flights land."}]
3c:["$","h2","h2-3",{"id":"jeddah-specific-things-to-know","children":"Jeddah-specific things to know"}]
3d:["$","h3","h3-4",{"id":"arriving-at-jed","children":"Arriving at JED"}]
3e:["$","p","p-7",{"children":["King Abdulaziz International Airport is north of the city. Your terminal and arrival time matter more than anything for a smooth pickup — share your ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"flight number"}]," when you book and we check it before pickup. Allow time for immigration and baggage, which can be slow when several wide-body flights arrive together. More detail: ",["$","$L25","a-0",{"href":"/airports/king-abdulaziz-jeddah","children":"Jeddah Airport pickups"}],"."]}]
3f:["$","h3","h3-5",{"id":"going-to-makkah-from-the-airport","children":"Going to Makkah from the airport"}]
40:["$","p","p-8",{"children":["This is the most-booked Jeddah journey. If you are performing Umrah, you will normally be in Ihram already (it is entered on the plane — see our ",["$","$L25","a-0",{"href":"/blog/complete-miqat-locations-guide-umrah-pilgrims","children":"Miqat guide"}],"). Keep passports handy for the checkpoint on the road into Makkah."]}]
41:["$","h3","h3-6",{"id":"car-or-haramain-train-to-makkah-or-madinah","children":"Car or Haramain train to Makkah or Madinah?"}]
42:["$","p","p-9",{"children":["The Haramain high-speed railway has a station at the airport and one in the city (Al Sulaymaniyah). It is fast between stations, but neither the Makkah nor the Madinah station is beside the Haram, so you need a car at the other end — and there are luggage limits. We compare the two honestly in our ",["$","$L25","a-0",{"href":"/blog/jeddah-to-madinah-taxi-guide-fares","children":"Jeddah Airport to Madinah guide"}],"."]}]
43:["$","h3","h3-7",{"id":"around-the-city","children":"Around the city"}]
44:["$","p","p-10",{"children":["For a few short hops — Al-Balad, the Corniche, a mall — an app ride or street taxi may cost less than a private booking. Where a private car pays off is when you want a driver to wait, need child seats or space for luggage, or are going to several places in one afternoon; then an ",["$","$L25","a-0",{"href":"/blog/private-driver-cost-saudi-arabia","children":"hourly booking"}]," is usually better value."]}]
45:["$","h2","h2-4",{"id":"tipping-and-payment","children":"Tipping and payment"}]
46:["$","p","p-11",{"children":["Tipping is not expected — the agreed fare is complete. Some travellers give a small tip for help with heavy luggage; that is entirely optional. You can pay ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"cash to the driver or by bank transfer"}],", and an ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"electronic receipt"}]," is available on request. Bookings can be ",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"cancelled free of charge up to 24 hours before pickup"}],"."]}]
47:["$","h2","h2-5",{"id":"how-to-get-an-exact-jeddah-fare","children":"How to get an exact Jeddah fare"}]
48:["$","p","p-12",{"children":"Send us the pickup point (airport terminal or hotel), the destination, the date and time, the number of passengers and bags, and any stops. We reply with the vehicle that fits and one fixed price. Nothing is added later for the trip you described."}]
49:["$","h2","h2-6",{"id":"common-questions","children":"Common questions"}]
4a:["$","h3","h3-8",{"id":"how-much-is-a-taxi-from-jeddah-airport-to-makkah","children":"How much is a taxi from Jeddah Airport to Makkah?"}]
4b:["$","p","p-13",{"children":"It is quoted per trip, depending on the vehicle and the number of passengers and bags. The route is about 80 km and takes around an hour; your fare is confirmed before you book."}]
4c:["$","h3","h3-9",{"id":"is-a-private-transfer-more-expensive-than-a-street-taxi","children":"Is a private transfer more expensive than a street taxi?"}]
4d:["$","p","p-14",{"children":"For a short city ride, often yes. For the airport, Makkah or Madinah — especially at night, with luggage or with a family — a fixed-price private transfer is usually comparable or better, and you know the total in advance."}]
4e:["$","h3","h3-10",{"id":"can-i-book-a-ride-for-right-now","children":"Can I book a ride for right now?"}]
4f:["$","p","p-15",{"children":"Yes — booking is available 24/7. Same-day bookings depend on vehicle availability, so booking ahead gives you the widest choice, especially in Ramadan and the peak Umrah months."}]
